    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχαστηρία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trigger, release-mechanism</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				398b15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				74.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				13.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Bel.</u>
				78.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.5.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.6.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				188.7
			</span></i>; <i>trigger</i> (worked by the foot) of a mechanism (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕσπληξ</span>) for starting a race, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).438
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> perh.
				<i>curtain-releasing mechanism</i>, or <i>curtain-rod</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκευάσαντι ς. χαλκᾶς εἰς τὸν νεὼ
					τοῦ Ἀσκληπιοῦ . . καὶ τῷ ἐνέντι τὰς ς. εἰς τὸν
					νεώ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					372
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				110
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρκων καὶ
				σχαστηριῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				320
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				67
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> pl., <i>attachments for relaxing</i> the pressure of a
			surgical noose, Heraclas ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.7.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> place-name
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.2776.17
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				203
			</span></i>.</div>
